   "description": "An AE was defined as any untoward medical occurrence in any participant participating in a clinical investigation, regardless of the suspected cause. An AE was therefore can be any unfavorable and unintended sign, symptom, disease, concurrent illness, or clinically significant abnormal laboratory finding that emerged or worsened during the study. A TEAE was defined as an AE that first occurred or worsened after initiation of study drug. An AE with missing relationship to study drug was considered as related to study drug.",
   "timeFrame": "Day 1 to Week 80"
