   "description": "Treprostinil for inhalation solution (0.6 mg/mL) delivered via an ultrasonic nebulizer which emits a dose of approximately 6 mcg per breath. Inhaled QID and titrated up to a target of 12 breaths QID or until the subject reaches their maximum clinically tolerated dose.",
   "interventionNames": [
    "Drug: Inhaled Treprostinil",
    "Device: Treprostinil Ultrasonic Nebulizer"
   ]
  }
 ],
 "interventions": [
  {
