 "briefSummary": "The purpose of this study is to determine whether neflamapimod can improve learning skills, problem solving skills, and memory loss in people diagnosed with DLB. More specifically, improvement in verbal learning, memory, and attention, as well as cognitive and functional performance will be measured.",
 "detailedDescription": "This study includes a 16-week blinded treatment period (randomized 1:1 neflamapimod:placebo) and a 32 week open-label extension during which all participants receive neflamapimod.",
