   "description": "RSV-LRTD: Reverse transcriptase polymerase chain reaction (RT PCR) confirmed RSV infection PLUS new or worsening of ≥2 of the following symptoms: shortness of breath, cough and/or fever (≥37.8 degrees Celsius \\[°C\\]), wheezing and/or rales and/or rhonchi, sputum production, tachypnea (≥20 breaths/minute or increase of ≥ 2 breaths/minute from baseline measurement in those who had baseline tachypnea), hypoxemia (new oxygen saturation ≤93% or new or increasing use of supplemental oxygen), pleuritic chest pain for ≥24 hours.",
   "timeFrame": "From 14 days postinjection up to 12 months postinjection"
