 "officialTitle": "Multicenter, Randomized, Double-Blind, Placebo-Controlled Study of the Efficacy and Safety of 0.15% & 0.25% Concentrations of Topical SM04554 Solution in Male Subjects With Androgenetic Alopecia",
 "leadSponsor": {
