  "interventionModelDescription": "Multicenter open-label randomized clinical trial with randomization within 4 strata, defined by donor-specific antibody status and center annual transplant volume. There are 2 parallel groups of equal sizes for randomization: everolimus/low-dose tacrolimus and tacrolimus/mycophenolate mofetil.",
  "primaryPurpose": "TREATMENT",
  "maskingInfo": {
