   "timeFrame": "From randomization to Day 90 post-CPB (surgery with CPB was within 7 days after study drug administration on Day 1)"
  },
  {
   "measure": "Estimated Percentage of Participants Who Experienced MAKE at Day 30 (MAKE30) and Day 60 (MAKE60) Post-CPB Based on sCysC",
   "description": "MAKE30 and MAKE60 were defined as meeting at least one of the following criteria:\n\n* Decrease from baseline in eGFR (CKD-EPI formula using sCysC) of ≥ 25% at Day 30 or 60 post CPB,\n* Initiation of KRT through Days 30 or 60 post CPB, or\n* Death from any cause through Days 30 or 60 post CPB.\n\nEstimated percentages were calculated using imputation of missing data. Missing data for KRT initiation or death were imputed as non-events. Missing eGFR values were addressed using a two-step multiple imputation approach under the assumption of MAR.",
   "timeFrame": "Days 30 and 60 post-CPB (surgery with CPB was within 7 days after study drug administration on Day 1)"
  },
