   "description": "A participant is counted if a first occurrence of ISTH clinically relevant non-major bleeding occurred after randomization during the on-treatment period (including 2 days after treatment discontinuation). Time-to-event analysis was performed using a stratified Cox proportional hazards model to compare treatment groups over the follow-up period.",
   "timeFrame": "Up to 32 months"
  },
