   "description": "Delineation was assessed by blinded independent central review (BICR) readers on combined pre- and post-contrast MRI image sets for gadoquatrane and comparator macrocyclic GBCAs. Delineation was rated using a 4-point scale (1 = no or unclear delineation; 2 = moderate delineation; 3 = good delineation; 4 = excellent delineation), and mean scores with standard deviation are reported",
