   "measure": "Number of Cases With Concordance Between Final Diagnosis and MRI Diagnosis From Combined Pre- and Post- Gadoquatrane MRI and Combined Pre- and Post- Comparator MRI With Macrocyclic GBCAs, as Assessed by the Investigator",
