   "description": "INV-assessed DMFS was defined as the time from randomization to the first occurrence of a DMFS event, defined as diagnosis of distant (i.e., non-locoregional) metastasis or death from any cause. Data for participants without a DMFS event were censored at the last date the participant was assessed to be alive and free of distant metastasis. Data for participants with no post-baseline disease assessment were censored at the randomization date. KM methodology was used to estimate the median DMFS.",
   "timeFrame": "From randomization to the first occurrence of a DMFS event (Up to 48.2 months)"
