   "description": "Documentation of TEAEs (Safety and tolerability) from the start of treatment at Visit 2 (Day 1) up to the end of the Core Phase of the Treatment Period.",
   "timeFrame": "Visit 2 (Day 1) up to Visit 6 (Week 12/Day 84)"
  },
  {
