 "briefTitle": "Ultra-Short Course Bedaquiline, Clofazimine, Pyrazinamide and Delamanid Versus Standard Therapy for Drug-Susceptible Tuberculosis",
 "officialTitle": "A Phase IIc, Open-Label, Randomized Controlled Trial of Ultra-Short Course Bedaquiline, Clofazimine, Pyrazinamide and Delamanid Versus Standard Therapy for Drug-Susceptible Tuberculosis (PRESCIENT)",
 "leadSponsor": {
