   "measure": "Median Time to Stable Liquid Culture Conversion by Week 8",
   "description": "Culture conversion is defined as the first of two negative sputum cultures, consecutive or not, without an intervening positive culture, and/or visits wherein the participant is unable to produce sputum and has no signs or symptoms of active tuberculosis (TB).",
