   "description": "AEs include any occurrence that is new in onset or aggravated at least one-grade from baseline.\n\nAE's are graded according to the Division of AIDS Table for Grading the Severity of Adult and Pediatric Adverse Events (DAIDS AE Grading Table), Corrected Version 2.1, July 2017.",
