   "measure": "Percentage of Subjects With ≥ 10 and ≥ 15 ETDRS Letters Improvement in mLCVA Compared to Baseline (Day 1 Pre-dose) at Days 3, 8, and 15 (≥ 10 ETDRS Letters Only) and Week 6",
