   "label": "Sequence Atrasentan/Placebo",
   "type": "EXPERIMENTAL",
   "description": "Once daily oral administration of 0.75 mg atrasentan for 12 weeks (Period A) followed by once daily oral administration of placebo for 24 weeks (Period B)",
   "interventionNames": [
