 "briefTitle": "EMANATE: A Study of Setmelanotide in Patients With Specific Gene Variants in the MC4R Pathway",
 "officialTitle": "A Phase 3, Randomized, Double-Blind, Placebo-Controlled Trial: Multiple Independent Sub-studies of Setmelanotide in Patients With POMC/PCSK1, LEPR, NCOA1(SRC1), or SH2B1 Gene Variants in the Melanocortin-4 Receptor Pathway",
 "leadSponsor": {
  "name": "Rhythm Pharmaceuticals, Inc.",
