 "enrollment": 296,
 "briefSummary": "The protocol describes a randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled trial with independent sub-studies of setmelanotide in participants with obesity and at least one of the specific gene variants in the Melanocortin-4 Receptor pathway:\n\n* Pro-opiomelanocortin (POMC) or proprotein convertase subtilisin/kexin type 1 (PCSK1; Sub-study 035a)\n* Leptin receptor (LEPR; Sub-study 035b)\n* Nuclear receptor coactivator 1 (NCOA1; steroid receptor coactivator 1 \\[SCR1\\]; Sub-study 035c)\n* Steroid receptor coactivator-1 homology 2 B adapter protein 1 (SH2B1; Sub-study 035d)\n\nThe objectives and endpoints are identical for these sub-studies.",
 "arms": [
  {
   "label": "POMC or PCSK1 variant",
