  "interventionModel": "PARALLEL",
  "interventionModelDescription": "Each household will be randomized to either receive a single-dose of azithromycin or receive non-antibiotic placebo. All study visits after the drug administration, which occurs during the first visit, are equal for both groups.",
  "primaryPurpose": "PREVENTION",
  "maskingInfo": {
