   "description": "Clinical worsening was monitored from randomization until 1 of the following criteria were met: death (all causes), hospitalization due to a respiratory indication, or 10% relative decline in % predicted FVC. The number of participants with clinical worsening was reported. The time to first clinical worsening event was analyzed by stratified log-rank test (p-value) and presented with the hazard ratio calculated by proportional hazards model with treatment and baseline background therapy as explanatory variables.",
