 "briefSummary": "This is a study to demonstrate the clinical efficacy and safety of the nanobody® sonelokimab administered subcutaneously (sc) compared with placebo in the treatment of adult participants with active psoriatic arthritis. The study includes adalimumab treatment as an active reference arm.",
 "detailedDescription": "Patients will be randomized to receive one of three sonelokimab treatment regimes, adalimumab or placebo. Primary efficacy evaluation will take place at Week 12. Patients will be allocated to a further 12 weeks of treatment with sonelokimab or adalimumab based on response assessment at week 12. In certain countries, treatment will end at week 12.",
