   "description": "Serum samples were collected at scheduled visits during the double-blind treatment period. Changes in ALP were evaluated using a mixed-effects repeated-measures model (MMRM) to assess the effects of treatment groups over time. Baseline was defined as the mean of all available evaluations prior to the first administration of investigational product. Change from Baseline was calculated as post Baseline value minus Baseline value.",
   "timeFrame": "Baseline to Week 12"
  }
 ],
