   "type": "DRUG",
   "name": "Erenumab Dose 2",
   "description": "Participants in the low body-weight group at day 1 who are randomized to Dose Level 2 and participants in the high body-weight group at day 1 who are randomized to Dose Level 1 will receive this dose.",
   "armGroupLabels": [
