 "briefTitle": "A Study of Adeno-Associated Virus Serotype 8-Mediated Gene Transfer of Glucose-6-Phosphatase in Patients With Glycogen Storage Disease Type Ia (GSDIa)",
 "officialTitle": "A Phase 3, Randomized, Double-Blind, Placebo-Controlled Study of Adeno-Associated Virus Serotype 8-Mediated Gene Transfer of Glucose-6-Phosphatase in Patients With Glycogen Storage Disease Type Ia",
 "leadSponsor": {
